        0.7858095068884099,
        0.3163848254399919
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 5,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "NOTE\n",
      "bbox": [
        284.262939453125,
        266.81085205078125,
        314.3664245605469,
        277.31085205078125
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.4731170736608161,
        0.34566363989605964,
        0.5232202380353757,
        0.35926679055882893
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 6,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "The vertical is like the horizontal—as there are alternating long and short lines, there \nare also long and short fields (interlace only). In NTSC, the fields are 262, then 263 \nlines and in PAL, 312,313.\n",
      "bbox": [
        109.512939453125,
        285.9108581542969,
        492.27996826171875,
        322.0588684082031
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.18226942119762507,
        0.37040842662805357,
        0.8193331795340492,
        0.4172395532607408
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 7,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "This alternation of lines & fields produces the standard NTSC 4 field repeating pattern:\n",
      "bbox": [
        85.06294250488281,
        337.7078552246094,
        465.1418762207031,
        348.2078552246094
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.14157572039574567,
        0.4375134128210517,
        0.7741655093626076,
        0.451116563483821
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 8,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "short field ending on short line \nlong field ending on long line \nshort field ending on long line \nlong field ending on short line \n& back to the beginning...\n",
      "bbox": [
        120.81294250488281,
        363.4078674316406,
        258.1004943847656,
        424.8058776855469
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
